# CrioSoft Additional Permissions

CrioSoft LLC grants these permissions in addition to the PolyForm
Noncommercial License 1.0.0 below. Words in bold there ("you", "your
company", "control", "software", "use") mean the same here. Everything
the PolyForm Noncommercial License requires of you, other than limiting
use to noncommercial purposes, applies to use under these permissions
too.

## Small Business Permission

You may use the software for any purpose, including commercial purposes,
if the software runs on no more than three computers in total for you,
your company, and every organization under common control with your
company. A computer means each physical or virtual machine on which the
software is installed. If the total is more than three, this permission
does not cover any of those computers, and each one needs a CrioSoft
Commercial License.

## Evaluation Permission

Your company may use the software for any purpose on up to ten computers,
for one period of no more than thirty days, to decide whether to buy a
CrioSoft Commercial License.

## What These Permissions Do Not Cover

These permissions cover using the software. They do not allow selling,
renting or sublicensing the software, distributing it as part of a
product or service you sell, or using it to protect computers that you
manage for other people or organizations in return for payment. Those
need a separate agreement with CrioSoft LLC.

